                    <br />
                    <span class="fun-fact"><strong>80% of the agency used it · 60%+ monthly active · 27,000+ conversations · 200+ Brand Agents.</strong> <a href="https://digiday.com/marketing/build-or-buy-inside-indie-agency-mod-ops-ai-infrastructure/" target="_blank">Digiday put Orion's avoided licensing costs at roughly $3M</a>, August 2026.</span>
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong><a href="/geo">GEO by Mod Op</a></strong> Brand visibility monitoring across major AI platforms. I directed the product's design and build, working with subject-matter experts to connect it to Mod Op's AI platform. I shaped the funnel from free audit to paid program and supported go-to-market. It's live at <a href="https://geo.modop.ai" target="_blank">geo.modop.ai</a>.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong><a href="/launchpad">Launchpad</a></strong> A self-serve framework for teams to deploy prototype tools and agents, with governance and evaluation built in and a real path to production.
                    <br />
                    <span class="fun-fact">Sixty-plus working prototypes out of the Q1 2026 hackathons, each demonstrated in under a minute.</span>
